integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.source:
Some files already exist in the InkSim extension folder. Files listed for replacement may contain user changes. Other listed files will be preserved and never deleted.

Files to replace:
{replace_files}

Files to preserve:
{preserve_files}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.translation:
Tá roinnt comhad san fhillteán síneadh InkSim cheana féin. Seans go bhfuil athruithe úsáideora sna comhaid atá liostaithe lena n-ionadú. Caomhnófar na comhaid eile atá liostaithe agus ní scriosfar iad choíche.

Comhaid le hionadú:
{replace_files}

Comhaid le caomhnú:
{preserve_files}

Lean ar aghaidh?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.source:
The listed user extension folders and all files inside them will be permanently deleted. The current install/update target and system extension folders will not be removed.

{directories}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.translation:
Scriosfar go buan na fillteáin shínte úsáideora atá liostaithe agus gach comhad iontu. Ní bhainfear an sprioc reatha suiteála/nuashonraithe ná fillteáin shínte an chórais.

{directories}

Lean ar aghaidh?
